examine-something = Examine an object [tutkeybind="UIClick"/]

base-tutorial-sender = Mentor:
tutorial-base-step-examine-bubble = Examine the object. Use [tutkeybind="ExamineEntity"].
tutorial-base-step-examine-chat = Great! Let us begin by examining objects.
tutorial-base-step-examine-tts = Great! Let us begin by examining objects.
tutorial-base-step-pickup-bubble = Pick up the object.
tutorial-base-step-pickup-chat = Pick up the object to hold it in your hand.
tutorial-base-step-pickup-tts = Pick up the object to hold it in your hand.
tutorial-base-step-activate-action-chat = Activate the textured button on the action bar, on the left or at the top.
tutorial-base-step-activate-action-tts = Activate the action.
tutorial-base-step-use-bubble = Use the object in your hand. Press [tutkeybind="UseItemInHand"].
tutorial-base-step-use-chat = Now use the object in your hand.
tutorial-base-step-use-tts = Now use the object in your hand.
tutorial-base-step-equip-bubble = Equip the object in a clothing slot.
tutorial-base-step-equip-chat = Drag the object onto yourself to equip it.
tutorial-base-step-equip-tts = Drag the object onto yourself to equip it.
tutorial-base-step-drop-bubble = Drop the object on the floor [tutkeybind="Drop"].
tutorial-base-step-drop-chat = Drop the object from your hand.
tutorial-base-step-drop-tts = Drop the object from your hand.
tutorial-base-step-interact-chat = Interact with the object.
tutorial-base-step-interact-tts = Interact with the object.
tutorial-base-step-reach-chat = Walk to the marked location.
tutorial-base-step-reach-tts = Walk to the marked location.
tutorial-base-step-attack-bubble = Hit any object or wall.
tutorial-base-step-attack-chat = Try attacking something.
tutorial-base-step-attack-tts = Try attacking something.
tutorial-base-walk-bubble = Walk around a little. Use [tutkeybind="MoveUp"] [tutkeybind="MoveLeft"] [tutkeybind="MoveDown"] [tutkeybind="MoveRight"].
tutorial-base-walk-chat = Walk around a little to learn how movement works.
tutorial-base-walk-tts = Walk around a little to learn how movement works.

# --- Introduction tutorial strings ---

intro-tut-walk-bubble = Walk around a little. Use [tutkeybind="MoveUp"] [tutkeybind="MoveLeft"] [tutkeybind="MoveDown"] [tutkeybind="MoveRight"].

intro-tut-go-locker-room-bubble = Go to the locker room; follow the marker on the floor.
intro-tut-go-locker-room-chat = Welcome aboard! First, let us visit the locker room and find some clothes.
intro-tut-go-locker-room-tts = Welcome aboard! First, let us visit the locker room and find some clothes.

intro-tut-take-clothing-bubble = Take a beret from the dispenser. Press [tutkeybind="UIClick"] on the item you want.
intro-tut-take-clothing-chat = This is a clothing dispenser. Select a beret.
intro-tut-take-clothing-tts = This is a clothing dispenser. Select a beret.

intro-tut-equip-clothing-bubble = Put on the beret. Open your inventory with [tutkeybind="OpenInventoryMenu"] and drag it into the correct slot, or press [tutkeybind="ActivateItemInHand"] to equip it quickly.
intro-tut-equip-clothing-chat = Put on that stylish beret. It will suit you.
intro-tut-equip-clothing-tts = Put on that stylish beret. It will suit you.

intro-tut-drop-old-clothing-bubble = Drop the old piece of clothing on the floor [tutkeybind="Drop"].
intro-tut-drop-old-clothing-chat = The old clothing is now in your hand. Just drop it.
intro-tut-drop-old-clothing-tts = The old clothing is now in your hand. Just drop it.

intro-tut-swap-hands-bubble = You have two hands! Press [tutkeybind="SwapHands"] to switch your active hand.
intro-tut-swap-hands-chat = You have two hands in the game. You can hold an object in each and switch between them quickly.
intro-tut-swap-hands-tts = You have two hands in the game. You can hold an object in each and switch between them quickly.

intro-tut-go-center-bubble = Go to the center of the area; follow the marker.
intro-tut-go-center-chat = Excellent! Now head to the central hall.
intro-tut-go-center-tts = Excellent! Now head to the central hall.

intro-tut-go-bar-bubble = Head to the bar; follow the marker.
intro-tut-go-bar-chat = Stop by the bar. It is a good place to catch your breath.
intro-tut-go-bar-tts = Stop by the bar. It is a good place to catch your breath.

intro-tut-sit-chair-bubble = Sit on a bar stool by using [tutkeybind="UIClick"] on it.
intro-tut-sit-chair-chat = Click the stool to sit down.
intro-tut-sit-chair-tts = Click the stool to sit down.

intro-tut-pickup-drink-bubble = Pick up the glass of orange juice from the counter [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-pickup-drink-chat = There is some orange juice on the counter. Pick it up!
intro-tut-pickup-drink-tts = There is some orange juice on the counter. Pick it up!

intro-tut-drink-bubble = Drink the juice [tutkeybind="ActivateItemInHand"].
intro-tut-drink-chat = Hold the glass in your hand and activate it to drink.
intro-tut-drink-tts = Hold the glass in your hand and activate it to drink.

intro-tut-go-bar-counter-bubble = Go behind the counter; follow the marker.
intro-tut-go-bar-counter-chat = I wonder what is hidden behind the counter...
intro-tut-go-bar-counter-tts = I wonder what is hidden behind the counter...

intro-tut-examine-airlock-bubble = Examine the service airlock [tutkeybind="ExamineEntity"].
intro-tut-examine-airlock-chat = This airlock appears to be locked. You cannot pass without access.
intro-tut-examine-airlock-tts = This airlock appears to be locked. You cannot pass without access.

intro-tut-rummage-bush-bubble = Search the nearby bush [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-rummage-bush-chat = Something is hidden in the bushes. Take a look!
intro-tut-rummage-bush-tts = Something is hidden in the bushes. Take a look!

intro-tut-equip-id-card-bubble = Place the access card in your ID slot by using [tutkeybind="UIClick"] on the ID-card slot.
intro-tut-equip-id-card-chat = The access card opens service doors. Equip it!
intro-tut-equip-id-card-tts = The access card opens service doors. Equip it!

intro-tut-pass-airlock-bubble = Hold the access card in your hand and pass through the airlock [tutkeybind="ActivateItemInWorld"].
intro-tut-pass-airlock-chat = The access card opens service doors. Hold it in your hand to pass through.
intro-tut-pass-airlock-tts = The access card opens service doors. Hold it in your hand to pass through.

intro-tut-open-dresser-bubble = Open the dresser [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-open-dresser-chat = The dresser is empty. Someone got here before us.
intro-tut-open-dresser-tts = The dresser is empty. Someone got here before us.

intro-tut-go-back-center-bubble = Return to the central hall.
intro-tut-go-back-center-chat = There is nothing else to find here. Back to the center.
intro-tut-go-back-center-tts = There is nothing else to find here. Back to the center.

intro-tut-go-hallway-bubble = Continue towards the next corridor.
intro-tut-go-hallway-chat = Hmm... something ahead is not right. The lights are out.
intro-tut-go-hallway-tts = Hmm... something ahead is not right. The lights are out.

intro-tut-pickup-flashlight-bubble = It is dark here! Pick up the flashlight [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-pickup-flashlight-chat = You will not get far through dark corridors without a flashlight.
intro-tut-pickup-flashlight-tts = You will not get far through dark corridors without a flashlight.

intro-tut-turn-on-flashlight-bubble = Turn on the flashlight [tutkeybind="ActivateItemInHand"].
intro-tut-turn-on-flashlight-chat = Activate the object in your hand to turn on the flashlight.
intro-tut-turn-on-flashlight-tts = Activate the object in your hand to turn on the flashlight.

intro-tut-go-range-bubble = Head to the firing range.
intro-tut-go-range-chat = There is a firing range ahead. Time for some practice.
intro-tut-go-range-tts = There is a firing range ahead. Time for some practice.

intro-tut-try-open-bolted-bubble = Try to open the airlock [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-try-open-bolted-chat = The door is bolted! You need to release the bolts.
intro-tut-try-open-bolted-tts = The door is bolted! You need to release the bolts.

intro-tut-press-button-bubble = Press the nearby signal button [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-press-button-chat = This button will release the bolts. Press it!
intro-tut-press-button-tts = This button will release the bolts. Press it!

intro-tut-pickup-pistol-bubble = Pick up the practice laser pistol [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-pickup-pistol-chat = This is a great chance to practise shooting. Pick up the pistol!
intro-tut-pickup-pistol-tts = This is a great chance to practise shooting. Pick up the pistol!

intro-tut-combat-mode-bubble = Enter combat mode by pressing [tutkeybind="Num1"] (the 1 key).
intro-tut-combat-mode-chat = You need to enter combat mode to attack with a weapon. Press 1.
intro-tut-combat-mode-tts = You need to enter combat mode to attack with a weapon. Press 1.

intro-tut-shoot-bubble = Shoot the targets three times by using [tutkeybind="UIClick"] on them.
intro-tut-shoot-chat = Aim at the targets and open fire!
intro-tut-shoot-tts = Aim at the targets and open fire!

intro-tut-pickup-knife-bubble = Pick up the survival knife [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-pickup-knife-chat = Sometimes a firearm is not an option. Take the knife.
intro-tut-pickup-knife-tts = Sometimes a firearm is not an option. Take the knife.

intro-tut-attack-clown-bubble = Attack the clown target [tutkeybind="UIClick"].
intro-tut-attack-clown-chat = Strike the target. That is how melee combat works!
intro-tut-attack-clown-tts = Strike the target. That is how melee combat works!

intro-tut-drop-drink-bubble = Put the glass back down [tutkeybind="Drop"].
intro-tut-drop-drink-chat = Remember to put the glass down. There is no need to carry it around.
intro-tut-drop-drink-tts = Remember to put the glass down. There is no need to carry it around.

intro-tut-drop-id-card-bubble = Drop the access card [tutkeybind="Drop"]; you will not need it again.
intro-tut-drop-id-card-chat = The card has done its job. Drop it.
intro-tut-drop-id-card-tts = The card has done its job. Drop it.

intro-tut-store-flashlight-bubble = Put the flashlight in your backpack or drop it ([tutkeybind="Drop"]) before shooting.
intro-tut-store-flashlight-chat = Free your hands before picking up a weapon.
intro-tut-store-flashlight-tts = Free your hands before picking up a weapon.
